release excluded. Expect indeterminate/not_performed where evidence is absent, never upgraded by a positive technical result.\\n\\nIndependence expectations: nonauthor premise holds per policy only if actual producer binding shows this Reviewer authored no candidate contribution; same family/new process certifies nothing; unknown prior/external/host/managed/memory exposure and mental continuity remain unknown.\\n\\nLimits/unread scope: FD013 remainder after line230, fd-support-tools tail, FDV lines51-64 content read but its acquisition ref not bound, PRODUCT after line100, INTENT.md, REFERENCE_FRAME_BASIS.md, fd-source-owner-map.md, stdo_a_c.json, all 12 RC9 method members except ASSURANCE 680-756 and FOUNDATIONS 790-850 (Conjunction of results, ACTIVATION, EVALUATION, REFERENCE_FRAME 281-440 not read), METHOD_INDEX/CLAUSE_POINTERS read lines1-40 only. Expectations are therefore partial against owner clauses and may need refinement in phase2 transparently, not silently.\"","coordinates":{"json_pointer":"/payload/text"},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"4387cefa103592b5a76c96d288da403f9211bc3107843bc8dbfa63c501653f61","selected_sha256":"c453e4b16742c79b30e62ffd8f14c5e6e2b78fbbf1775736e41bfbca2af3ca2a","size_bytes":5619,"source":{"engine":"retained-evidence","object":null,"path":"sha256:4387cefa103592b5a76c96d288da403f9211bc3107843bc8dbfa63c501653f61","root":"evidence","selector":{"json_pointer":"/payload/text"},"sha256":"4387cefa103592b5a76c96d288da403f9211bc3107843bc8dbfa63c501653f61"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011MFrTMNeBMN94gdbovrrA8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
