ency or independence. In phase2 identify and preserve the actual earlier expectation judgment/evidence/provenance; do not fabricate a fresh derivation or silently change its original predicate/result.\\n\\n## design-conservation\\n\\nAssess the finite current HOW against its governing WHAT and selected RC9 design foundation: ontology, axioms, Prime, three views, decision-completeness, meaning/authority/category boundaries and coherent extensibility. Assess structural and semantic conservation to the declared finite domain, distinguishing supported design obligations from future use or evidence requirements. Determine the actual supported result and findings directly; no implementation/test/actor qualification result automatically decides this predicate.\\n\\n## implementation-conservation\\n\\nAssess the current declared code, public helpers and interfaces against their exact own contracts/HOW and governing WHAT. Check actual semantics of the declared transformations, boundaries, identities, authority, effects, source/acquisition, returns and refusals using independently acquired source and selected deciding raw proof. Passing checks are scoped evidence. Distinguish demonstrated defects, missing proof, unsupported variants and actual unperformed scope. Determine this predicate independently of guide and public-use qualification.\\n\\n## guide-task-criteria\\n\\nAssess the exact current guide against the supplied TASK acceptance criteria, actual public usage contracts and honest source/provenance/status claims. Determine whether its bounded lifecycle explanation and concrete examples are useful and supported by actual cited acquisition/effect/evidence scope. Preserve the original actor/work result separately; a guide judgment does not replace any original missing/negative/unknown return or qualification evidence. No guide prose or expected finding is supplied by this predicate.\\n\\n## public-use-qualification\\n\\nAssess actual FDV001/FDV002 scope exercised through the declared ordinary public Executive/Worker/Reviewer paths, including positive/negative controls, producer/source-first/source-delivery/currentness/effect/return evidence, actual failures/partials and remaining gaps. Report only the qualification demonstrated by actual evidence. Missing or unperformed actor qualification can remain indeterminate or not_performed without being substituted for design or implementation conservation; conversely a positive technical result cannot erase original negative/missing/unknown qualification evidence. FDV003/matched cost, full calculus, installed/release qualification and benefit claims are outside scope.\\n\\nPhase1 performs only source-derived-expectations to its actual supported scope; the other four IDs belong in not_performed. Its initial proof.expectations remains null and the intentional return-check gap remains explicit. Phase2 requires all five IDs under a separately frozen contract binding the real earlier expectation; reuse that earlier judgment transparently and assess the four later predicates separately. Each actual core_value, evidence, consequence and limitation belongs to the Reviewer. Root later consumes these distinct results and owns its separate disposition. No Product acceptance, installation, release or benefit follows.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"a53828d226ae4c74eed8d0c38b84f1902457ea80b82dfc6c9a4f3472fdaa2b8b\",\"selected_sha256\":\"a53828d226ae4c74eed8d0c38b84f1902457ea80b82dfc6c9a4f3472fdaa2b8b\",\"size_bytes\":4350,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"review-evaluation.md\",\"root\":\"runtime\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"a53828d226ae4c74eed8d0c38b84f1902457ea80b82dfc6c9a4f3472fdaa2b8b\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:9347a3f30e043dda1adbf3d709eeac06fd1e735e838083bd0f0126146c44efa2","sha256":"9347a3f30e043dda1adbf3d709eeac06fd1e735e838083bd0