{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EfWoK6jJzerCnChDhYLuP5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:688ed71feb57f40c40dfe881c43625175ee9b12c2ce35f6215a6887a6e9002d8\",\"sha256\":\"688ed71feb57f40c40dfe881c43625175ee9b12c2ce35f6215a6887a6e9002d8\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-prod-003\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=d70050c259578d3e5ad91d7b2a9a8fb5098eb079ece2c6181636da88753e9664]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"| Assemble/check caller-selected reference-frame context; preflight execution contracts | Render the method-owned activation from supplied selections and exact content; check the declared closure, envelope, bindings and Product-bound admission evidence without inventing authority. |\\n| Dispatch through a selected executor; retain observations and notifications | Supply exact context/settings and the existing grant, and expose acknowledgment, output, observed effects, partial evidence and exceptions to the declared consumer. |\\n| Capture/check closed returns; prepare review comparisons; execute declared checks and joins | Preserve actor outputs and their provenance; inspect exact candidate/source/proof, detect binding errors, and evaluate only supported supplied predicates or method-owned operators. |\\n| Project/record existing work and evidence; prepare affected refresh/handoff; retain usage | Read existing owned carriers and apply already-authorized records through named Writer interfaces; preserve actual support, unresolved impact/effects and measured attempt costs across sessions. |\\n\\nThese are tools available at the points where the selected method and F_P actor\\nneed them, not an a_c stage sequence, task-state store or agent topology.\\nPublic interfaces must support direct Worker and Reviewer source/context/proof\\naccess as well as Executive use. Commands, MCP/protocols, storage, executor,\\nprovider and concrete schemas remain tenant HOW. Existing work/evidence owners\\nremain authoritative; a tool view or recorded recommendation is not a decision.\\n\\nIn the target calculus, `F_D[v]` is deterministic evaluation/proof over declared\\nproperties and returns a judgment. Source acquisition, context rendering,\\nserialization, dispatch and authorized recording are named domain operations\\nwith their own contracts; the `F_D` label does not merge their identities or\\nconfer effects. The deterministic wrapper may invoke an F_P actor, but its\\nsemantic output remains F_P. Qualified deterministic evaluation of an already-\\ndeclared predicate or method-owned conjunction is supported only within its\\nexplicit checked fragment; F_P supplies semantic selection and unresolved\\njudgment. Existing source-to-model F_P authoring remains a separate capability,\\nnot one of these new deterministic evaluations.\\n\\n## Method ownership and basis roles\\n\\nThe [source-owner map](requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md) binds provisional\\nSTDO3.0 derivation reference commit\\n`494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27`, package\\n`specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/`, tree\\n`082df4ea2b7b3658aab528bbfbcfe81234ccc810`, with exact member digests and deciding\\nclauses for each tool requirement. That common candidate is not accepted,\\nreleased or installed. It identifies the contracts from which the requested\\ntoolset is derived; it is not an operative a_c constitution or a published v3\\nrelease identity.\\n\\nThis implementation's builder remains the exact installed STDO v2.5.1-rc.2\\nselected in `stdo_a_c.json`. A consumer workspace's exact selected operative\\nmethod/profile is a separate input, and represented subject versions are another\\nbasis role. A supported binding or explicitly qualified translation must resolve\\nthose inputs; label equality, file presence and co-location do not compose them.\\nNo implicit latest adoption, V3 runtime dependency, sibling Product composition,\\nmethod acceptance or frozen-model regeneration follows from this source work.\\n\\n## Delivery and qualification boundary\\n\\nThe [deterministic support requirements](requirements/fd-support-tools.md) and\\n[qualification scenarios](requirements/fd-support-verification.md) specify the\\nrequested Product outcome. Their status is Deferred because owning design and\\nrealization are pending, not because the outcome is withdrawn. Current codecs,\\nprojections, source-generation scripts and worker launch facilities are building\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[61,110]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"6e5b90bfcdd206976af667d4aefc9eca77a6a883753c69d1485c61a3d1ea7889\",\"size_bytes\":3896,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[61,110]},\"sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d70f2d0-ea95-44de-98cd-d06e9ca7170b","uuid":"a1edb41f-2cf5-47e8-b517-26d1189d298e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:44:06.015Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:688ed71feb57f40c40dfe881c43625175ee9b12c2ce35f6215a6887a6e9002d8\",\"sha256\":\"688ed71feb57f40c40dfe881c43625175ee9b12c2ce35f6215a6887a6e9002d8\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-prod-003\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output avail