acceptance or frozen-model regeneration follows from this source work.\\n\\n## Delivery and qualification boundary\\n\\nThe [deterministic support requirements](requirements/fd-support-tools.md) and\\n[qualification scenarios](requirements/fd-support-verification.md) specify the\\nrequested Product outcome. Their status is Deferred because owning design and\\nrealization are pending, not because the outcome is withdrawn. Current codecs,\\nprojections, source-generation scripts and worker launch facilities are building\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[61,110]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"6e5b90bfcdd206976af667d4aefc9eca77a6a883753c69d1485c61a3d1ea7889\",\"size_bytes\":3896,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[61,110]},\"sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:688ed71feb57f40c40dfe881c43625175ee9b12c2ce35f6215a6887a6e9002d8","sha256":"688ed71feb57f40c40dfe881c43625175ee9b12c2ce35f6215a6887a6e9002d8"},"id":"p2-read-prod-003","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=d70050c259578d3e5ad91d7b2a9a8fb5098eb079ece2c6181636da88753e9664]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f"},"value":"returned"},"refusal":null,"result":{"artifact":null,"value":{"acquisition":{},"content":"| Assemble/check caller-selected reference-frame context; preflight execution contracts | Render the method-owned activation from supplied 