ilder: the unchanged installed `stdo_a_c.json` basis,\\n  STDO v2.5.1-rc.2, manifest\\n  `3d860ff4c1746f06ac25295a9e205cffb8e7725869615ac77cf2304b70ff2782`.\\n- Consumer operation: the exact method/profile and Product authority selected\\n  by that consumer. A tool binding must explicitly support it. This provisional\\n  source reference is not silently substituted for the consumer's method.\\n\\nAll members below are relative to that package. Their SHA-256 values bind exact\\nUTF-8 member bytes in the selected Git object, without relying on the location\\nor mutable state of another worktree. Retrieve a deciding member from this\\nrepository's object database, for example:\\n\\n```sh\\ngit show 494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27:specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/standards/ACTIVATION.md\\n```\\n\\nNo v3 release URI, remote/GitHub availability, Product composition, runtime\\ndependency on the candidate or regenerated frozen representation is asserted.\\nIf the exact objects/bytes are unavailable, this derivation reference is\\nunresolved; a moving branch or similarly named member is not a replacement.\\n\\n## Owning members and deciding clauses\\n\\nThe labels below route each requirement to its upstream owner. The clause names\\nand Markdown anchors name that exact member's sections; they do not copy the\\nrules into a_c or select the optional profile. Derived references retain the\\nowner's conditions, permissions, exclusions and limits.\\n\\n### PDEF\\n\\nMember: `standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md`.\\nSHA-256: `9287fd7387fcab2bcebfaf7192a4616ce1117e77cd814af4f1ac0558a2a037a6`.\\nDeciding clauses: §4 (`4-shared-installed-release-basis-and-toolchain-manager`),\\n§8 (`8-what-how-and-work-carriers`), §11\\n(`11-one-constitutional-surface-and-version-boundary`) and §12 (`12-bootstrap`).\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[1,50]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"f23291b36c5ba7181e39ecd1f7d4515ec72b2a82a8c70735be3ac85bde7d7c9b\",\"size_bytes\":2543,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[1,50]},\"sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:51b16a4a622f019944988ffd023cb60f08dca67d5e07b04defb85bfa83351b25","sha256":"51b16a4a622f019944988ffd023cb60f08dca67d5e07b04defb85bfa83351b25"},"id":"p2-read-ownmap-002","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=d6aa5fc546f7e8e20559972ac69ecf2ad0f096f3357cb5fee70267f3810fb30d]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f"},"value":"returned"},"refusal":null,"result":{"artifact":null,"value":{"acquisition":{},"content":"# F_D Tooling Source-Owner Map\n\nThis is a read-only derivation reference for the additional deterministic tools.\nIt is not a method definition, installed release, adopted constitution or\nimplementation/qualification claim. STDO3.0 owns the method; a_c owns only the\ntool behavior specified in [the operation family](fd-support-tools.md).\n\n## Exact reference and basis roles\n\n- Derivation commit: `494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27`.\n- Repository package: `specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/`.\n- Package tree: `082df4ea2b7b3658aab528bbfbcfe81234ccc810`.\n- Status: common standalone V3 candidate, outside main at selection; not\n  accepted, released or installed. A later verification-only checkpoint does\n  not change this selected reference.\n- a_c builder: the unchanged installed `stdo_a_c.json` basis,\n  STDO v2.5.1-rc.2, manifest\n  `3d860ff4c1746f06ac25295a9e205cffb8e7725869615ac77cf2304b70ff2782`.\n- Consumer operation: the exact method/profile and Product authority selected\n  by that consumer. A tool binding must explicitly support it. This provisional\n  source reference is not silently substituted for the consumer's method.\n\nAll members below are relative to that package. Their SHA-256 values bind exact\nUTF-8 member bytes in the selected Git object, without relying on the location\nor mutable state of another worktree. Retrieve a deciding member from this\nrepository's object database, for example:\n\n```sh\ngit show 494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27:specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/standards/ACTIVATION.md\n```\n\nNo v3 release URI, remote/GitHub availability, Product composition, runtime\ndependency on the candidate or regenerated frozen representation is asserted.\nIf the exact objects/bytes are unavailable, this derivation reference is\nunresolved; a moving branch or similarly named member is not a replacement.\n\n## Owning members and deciding clauses\n\nThe labels below route each requirement to its upstream owner. The clause names\nand Markdown anchors name that exact member's sections; they do not copy the\nrules into a_c or select the optional profile. Derived references retain the\nowner's conditions, permissions, exclusions and limits.\n\n### PDEF\n\nMember: `standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md`.\nSHA-256: `9287fd7387fcab2bcebfaf7192a4616ce1117e77cd814af4f1ac0558a2a037a6`.\nDeciding clauses: §4 (`4-shared-installed-release-basis-and-toolchain-manager`),\n§8 (`8-what-how-and-work-carriers`), §11\n(`11-one-constitutional-surface-and-version-boundary`) and §12 (`12-bootstrap`).\n","coordinates":{"lines":[1,50]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7","selected_sha256":"f23291b36c5ba7181e39ecd1f7d4515ec72b2a82a8c70735be3ac85bde7d7c9b","size_bytes":2543,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[1,50]},"sha256":"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VQ1NjH6kg7Aa6P8srB7fTp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
