{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EUBDK2ZNNa9grRqGb3UCjg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:cb6b77935e88000b29c02240f43c7a9bee6fb465beea31c3fe00ee3ce2ae40ac\",\"sha256\":\"cb6b77935e88000b29c02240f43c7a9bee6fb465beea31c3fe00ee3ce2ae40ac\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-ownmap-003\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=056d43483e94f06044cf4793ab647e6d2d10b2c9109b7143a15586a1e80a20a8]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"They own basis selection, source/derived authority, layout/tenant/carrier\\nbindings and the method/realization boundary.\\n\\n### FOUND\\n\\nMember: `standards/FOUNDATIONS.md`.\\nSHA-256: `8c8cf97691fc97fd9939bdbb07e2669435842a60a1d658e7121fb10f1d11c8a8`.\\nDeciding clauses: §4 `results`, `conjunction-of-results`,\\n`assertions-and-observation`, and `change-impact-and-evidence-reuse`.\\nThey own result and predicate meaning, method-owned joins, assertion/observation\\nclaims and supported change-impact/reuse. The tools implement only the declared\\ndecidable portion of the caller-selected contracts.\\n\\n### RF\\n\\nMember: `standards/REFERENCE_FRAME.md`.\\nSHA-256: `8152838639950b09389f99181172792100e4470b4807b4e112870cd4e6f6ba21`.\\nDeciding clauses: §3 RF-005/006/012/013/014/016; §6\\n(`6-frames-in-conjunction`); §8 (`8-workspace-coverage`); §10\\n(`10-discovery-and-revision`); §11 (`11-the-activation-packet`).\\nThese own exact frame binding, authority, reconstructability, capability,\\ncoverage, revision and the packet. a_c does not restate a second packet schema\\nor define frame selection.\\n\\n### ACT\\n\\nMember: `standards/ACTIVATION.md`.\\nSHA-256: `22e39f1c5804c297eec2982e0b859438222b83b3439a810eed58d89b84bbb619`.\\nDeciding clauses: §1 `intake`, `admission`, `applicability` and\\n`roles-and-delegation`; §2 (`2-context-construction-under-an-envelope`),\\nincluding Acquisition, Standalone scope and `staleness-of-derived-surfaces`;\\n§3 (`3-step-results-and-disposition`), including `effects`;\\n§5 (`5-work-state-and-restart`); §6 (`6-cost-and-proportionality`), including\\n`resource-limits`; §7 (`7-closed-result-and-reuse`). These own activation,\\ncontext fit/acquisition, effects and recovery, work-state and resource/reuse\\nsemantics. Tools expose corresponding checks and observations, not new states.\\n\\n### EVAL\\n\\nMember: `standards/EVALUATION.md`.\\nSHA-256: `3b30baee4f6941d35491e4ae0aa5e5a332f8b8afbae833dc3b4631da3426060e`.\\nDeciding clauses: §§1–6 (`1-claims`, `2-separation`,\\n`3-independent-assessment`, `4-review-results`, `5-acceptance`,\\n`when-a-finding-blocks-promotion`, `6-conformance-of-realisations`). These own\\nclaim/evidence boundaries, independence/exposure, review results and owner\\ndisposition. In particular review recommendations are not mechanically adopted\\nas dispositions. Source acquisition/diff/trace tools supply no semantic verdict.\\n\\n### ASSURE\\n\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[51,100]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"527078f0338e98f87e2f4c44b59833834250532ffb1697818497275b10c4fb32\",\"size_bytes\":2359,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[51,100]},\"sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d70f2d0-ea95-44de-98cd-d06e9ca7170b","uuid":"656252d9-7fe9-4ded-b88c-1345f8e1c16f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:45:03.898Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:cb6b77935e88000b29c02240f43c7a9bee6fb465beea31c3fe00ee3ce2ae40ac\",\"sha256\":\"cb6b77935e88000b29c02240f43c7a9bee6fb465beea31c3fe00ee3ce2ae40ac\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-ownmap-003\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=056d43483e94f06044cf4793ab647e6d2d10b2c9109b7143a15586a1e80a20a8]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"They own basis selection, source/derived authority, layout/tenant/carrier\\nbindings and the method/realization boundary.\\n\\n### FOUND\\n\\nMember: `standards/FOUNDATIONS.md`.\\nSHA-256: `8c8cf97691fc97fd9939bdbb07e2669435842a60a1d658e7121fb10f1d11c8a8`.\\nDeciding clauses: §4 `results`, `conjunction-of-results`,\\n`assertions-and-observation`, and `change-impact-and-evidence-reuse`.\\nThey own result and predicate meaning, method-owned joins, assertion/observation\\nclaims and supported change-impact/reuse. The tools implement only the declared\\ndecidable portion of the caller-selected contracts.\\n\\n### RF\\n\\nMember: `standards/REFERENCE_FRAME.md`.\\nSHA-256: `8152838639950b09389f99181172792100e4470b4807b4e112870cd4e6f6ba21`.\\nDeciding clauses: §3 RF-005/006/012/013/014/016; §6\\n(`6-frames-in-conjunction`); §8 (`8-workspace-coverage`); §10\\n(`10-discovery-and-revision`); §11 (`11-the-activation-packet`).\\nThese own exact frame binding, authority, reconstructability, capability,\\ncoverage, revision and the packet. a_c does not restate a second packet schema\\nor define frame selection.\\n\\n### ACT\\n\\nMember: `standards/ACTIVATION.md`.\\nSHA-256: `22e39f1c5804c297eec2982e0b859438222b83b3439a810eed58d89b84bbb619`.\\nDeciding clauses: §1 `intake`, `admission`, `applicability` and\\n`roles-and-delegation`; §2 (`2-context-construction-under-an-envelope`),\\nincluding Acquisition, Standalone scope and `staleness-of-derived-surfaces`;\\n§3 (`3-step-results-and-disposition`), including `effects`;\\n§5 (`5-work-state-and-restart`); §6 (`6-cost-and-proportionality`), including\\n`resource-limits`; §7 (`7-closed-result-and-reuse`). These own activation,\\ncontext fit/acquisition, effects and recovery, work-state and resource/reuse\\nsemantics. Tools expose corresponding checks and observations, not new states.\\n\\n### EVAL\\n\\nMember: `standards/EVALUATION.md`.\\nSHA-256: `3b30baee4f6941d35491e4ae0aa5e5a332f8b8afbae833dc3b4631da3426060e`.\\nDeciding clauses: §§1–6 (`1-claims`, `2-separation`,\\n`3-independent-assessment`, `4-review-results`, `5-acceptance`,\\n`when-a-finding-blocks-promotion`, `6-conformance-of-realisations`). These own\\nclaim/evidence boundaries, independence/exposure, review results and owner\\ndisposition. In particular review recommendations are not mechanically adopted\\nas dispositions. Source acquisition/diff/trace tools supply no semantic verdict.\\n\\n### ASSURE\\n\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[51,100]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"527078f0338e98f87e2f4c44b59833834250532ffb1697818497275b10c4fb32\",\"size_bytes\":2359,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[51,100]},\"sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-suppor