{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015TaPnvLnet9smQprk863PM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:d8ed678debf3ef35882e002c26ec16c34347e3a3df9f84cfd833a48f4aee070f\",\"sha256\":\"d8ed678debf3ef35882e002c26ec16c34347e3a3df9f84cfd833a48f4aee070f\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-ownmap-004\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=c3cb2a947590244fe56ea99908a7968ad566625ba57b18b1fb755e14b3012210]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"Member: `standards/ASSURANCE.md`.\\nSHA-256: `03e54928fa345897693bf7feaff64ba1aba3b06fd4a0a4304854b3ac26cdc349`.\\nDeciding clauses: §3 (`3-test-authority`); §10\\n(`10-testing-evidence-composition`); §§13–16\\n(`13-end-to-end-interface-integration-frame`, `14-design-to-module-evidence-route`,\\n`15-module-derived-unit-tests`, `16-module-lifecycle-confirmation`). They own\\ntest authority, proof composition and interface/module qualification. The tools\\npreserve exact source/proof/effect evidence and claim boundaries for F_P actors.\\n\\n### TICK\\n\\nMember: `standards/TICKETS.md`.\\nSHA-256: `5f7e4cb0785a27b9e6dda1fd91044e775183b6a0e6e80b33811e54665b144b57`.\\nDeciding clauses: §5 (`5-from-carrier-to-execution`, `carrier-selection`,\\n`execution-contract-admission`) and §7 (`7-authority-judgment-closure-and-state`,\\n`recorded-judgment-and-owner-ruling-continuity`,\\n`condition-based-closure-and-reuse`,\\n`one-truth-state-projection-and-drift-refusal-up-009`). They own work-carrier\\nselection/authority and recorded judgment/ruling/closure/state. Tool projections\\nand Writer interfaces do not create a new work ledger or choose dispositions.\\n\\n### EXEC\\n\\nMember: `standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md`.\\nSHA-256: `fcef434630e270d216f494de97ee727ad46690db89a4b73edac4b88ff921c62e`.\\nDeciding clauses: §2 (`2-status-and-authority-boundary`); §6\\n(`6-executive-attention-evaluation-and-action`, `event-driven-attention`,\\n`no-mutation-while-executive`); §§8–10 (`8-derived-executive-frame`,\\n`9-derived-worker-frame`, `10-derived-reviewer-frame`); §17\\n(`17-actor-binding-and-independence`); §19\\n(`19-baseline-specific-basis-and-activation-additions`). This is an optional\\nprofile. Its mappings and extra checks apply only when the consumer selects it;\\nfile presence, the derivation reference and a role label do not adopt it.\\n\\n### SPEC\\n\\nMember: `standards/SPEC_METHOD.md`.\\nSHA-256: `5fe14955b40d1b9763b788d91aacd939799225be032811524be85fce44128c3d`.\\nDeciding clauses: §4 (`4-change-management`, `universal-intake-triage`,\\n`computed-classification-and-treatment`) and §8\\n(`8-bounded-execution-in-this-method`). They own triage/re-entry and consume\\nbounded execution. Impact/classification tools return supplied/computed facts;\\nthey do not take over causal diagnosis, priority or authorized next-action choice.\\n\\n### AC\\n\\nMember: `standards/AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS.md`.\\nSHA-256: `fb56ac87f017abefd81416e28c5e2b6ef512caafa8c75c979cca4865af61cb87`.\\nDeciding clauses: §5 (`5-traversals-and-functor-kinds`,\\n`ac-015-functor-classification`, `ac-016-typed-composition`). `F_D[v]` evaluation\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[101,150]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"9af304a07b4a7f7a4aa36a357d5580f13b8d4796335f67920d2136f323113088\",\"size_bytes\":2563,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[101,150]},\"sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d70f2d0-ea95-44de-98cd-d06e9ca7170b","uuid":"06c95537-8757-4e94-b1c9-9cf550e4bd15","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:45:08.799Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:d8ed678debf3ef35882e002c26ec16c34347e3a3df9f84cfd833a48f4aee070f\",\"sha256\":\"d8ed678debf3ef35882e002c26ec16c34347e3a3df9f84cfd833a48f4aee070f\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-ownmap-004\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=c3cb2a947590244fe56ea99908a7968ad566625ba57b18b1fb755e14b3012210]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"Member: `standards/ASSURANCE.md`.\\nSHA-256: `03e54928fa345897693bf7feaff64ba1aba3b06fd4a0a4304854b3ac26cdc349`.\\nDeciding clauses: §3 (`3-test-authority`); §10\\n(`10-testing-evidence-composition`); §§13–16\\n(`13-end-to-end-interface-integration-frame`, `14-design-to-module-evidence-route`,\\n`15-module-derived-unit-tests`, `16-module-lifecycle-confirmation`). They own\\ntest authority, proof composition and interface/module qualification. The tools\\npreserve exact source/proof/effect evidence and claim boundaries for F_P actors.\\n\\n### TICK\\n\\nMember: `standards/TICKETS.md`.\\nSHA-256: `5f7e4cb0785a27b9e6dda1fd91044e775183b6a0e6e80b33811e54665b144b57`.\\nDeciding clauses: §5 (`5-from-carrier-to-execution`, `carrier-selection`,\\n`execution-contract-admission`) and §7 (`7-authority-judgment-closure-and-state`,\\n`recorded-judgment-and-owner-ruling-continuity`,\\n`condition-based-closure-and-reuse`,\\n`one-truth-state-projection-and-drift-refusal-up-009`). They own work-carrier\\nselection/authority and recorded judgment/ruling/closure/state. Tool projections\\nand Writer interfaces do not create a new work ledger or choose dispositions.\\n\\n### EXEC\\n\\nMember: `standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md`.\\nSHA-256: `fcef434630e270d216f494de97ee727ad46690db89a4b73edac4b88ff921c62e`.\\nDeciding clauses: §2 (`2-status-and-authority-boundary`); §6\\n(`6-executive-attention-evaluation-and-action`, `event-driven-attention`,\\n`no-mutation-while-executive`); §§8–10 (`8-derived-executive-frame`,\\n`9-derived-worker-frame`, `10-derived-reviewer-frame`); §17\\n(`17-actor-binding-and-independence`); §19\\n(`19-baseline-specific-basis-and-activation-additions`). This is an optional\\nprofile. Its mappings and extra checks apply only when the consumer selects it;\\nfile presence, the derivation reference and a role label do not adopt it.\\n\\n### SPEC\\n\\nMember: `standards/SPEC_METHOD.md`.\\nSHA-256: `5fe14955b40d1b9763b788d91aacd939799225be032811524be85fce44128c3d`.\\nDeciding clauses: §4 (`4-change-management`, `universal-intake-triage`,\\n`computed-classification-and-treatment`) and §8\\n(`8-bounded-execution-in-this-method`). They own triage/re-entry and consume\\nbounded execution. Impact/classification tools return supplied/computed facts;\\nthey do not take over causal diagnosis, priority or authorized next-action choice.\\n\\n### AC\\n\\nMember: `standards/AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS.md`.\\nSHA-256: `fb56ac87f017abefd81416e28c5e2b6ef512caafa8c75c979cca4865af61cb87`.\\nDeciding clauses: §5 (`5-traversals-and-functor-kinds`,\\n`ac-015-functor-classification`, `ac-016-typed-composition`). `F_D[v]` evaluation\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[101,150]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"0e9210865f0e1ffac67a6e12eb74d79467b561b739019bde4759254d470155e7