 across actor IO. | Admission is already complete. Release Product scope before waiting/streaming actor IO; later observers reacquire their bounded scope. Actual process start is an external effect, not transactionally coupled to evidence. Intent exists first; lost spawn/ack leaves completion_unknown, never automatic repeat. Fresh observation uses the anchor and actual process/subject evidence. | Registered executor only; arbitrary argv/projection-triggered execution unsupported. |\n| Writer membrane / one target record | Exact caller Worker/Writer grant, target preimage, intended whole postimage, authority/method/current dependencies, target lock and durable intent. | One whole target-file publication: complete new bytes or original/absent target. Existing replacement uses same-directory atomic replace; absent creation links a fully written/fsynced temp file exclusively into an absent target, never exposes a partially written new file. Reconstruct from durable intent and actual pre/post/other bytes; unknown other state cannot be reset or blindly retried. | Only named granted Writer interface for this tool domain; no Executive/Reviewer target impersonation or non-atomic fallback. |\n| Evidence store / immutable artifact or event | Exact complete envelope, all dependencies, provenance and content digest; protected namespace and existing evidence grant. | Complete same-directory atomic publication of one verified envelope. Raw/staged payloads are not admission markers. History only treats complete verified marker records as admitted evidence; orphan staging is not success. | One envelope grammar/verification path; optional indexes are nonauthoritative and rebuildable. |\n| Sink / one notification delivery | Registered sink id/root/consumer/retention and exact event payload, all already committed evidence refs. | One complete atomic sink event record. Delivery is that local publication; consumption is unobserved unless separately evidenced. Failed sink publication retains gap/fallback. | Registered durable-file-events sink only; no request-supplied network/file target. |\n\nA Writer intent is complete and durable **before** target publication and names\npreimage, exact intended postimage, operation/grant and request identity. The\nexternal target update and its post-observation/result publication are not one\ncross-filesystem transaction. An after-target evidence failure reports the\nactual observed effect or uncertainty, never rollback. A receipt/event/index\nfailure cannot expose a subset as the complete admitted relation. Public reads\nverify all referenced content and marker validity before using that relation.\n","coordinates":{"lines":[2700,2712]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005","selected_sha256":"73de038af4593832eb682a37473d06f47e0c200826c5b33b5ef75cd96306d247","size_bytes":3558,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[2700,2712]},"sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014cvo4yqMRQkEZnxmxiraDZ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAznLPLPzLgkxUY2RbHR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Swv9DvBHYa3wZ5ikrPtSBA","name":"mcp__ac_review__source_read","input":{"schema":"a_c.fd-support.request/1","id":"p2-read-how-p2850","operation":"source.read","arguments":{"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[2850,2862]},"sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005"},"encoding":"utf8","max_content_bytes":8192}},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3707,"cache_read_input_tokens":346628,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3707},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d70f2d0-ea95-44de-98cd-d06e9ca7170b","uuid":"1ece3824-2992-4c8d-9d69-64c9caee2f82","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:53:10.901Z","request_id":"req_011CgAznL5VSHhoMct5gaHfx","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Swv9DvBHYa3wZ5ikrPtSBA":{"schema":"a_c.fd-support.request/1","id":"p2-read-how-p2850","operation":"source.read","arguments":{"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[2850,2862]},"sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005"},"encoding":"utf8","max_content_bytes":8192}}},"tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Swv9DvBHYa3wZ5ikrPtSBA","display_name":"Source Read","server_display_name":"a_c.graphify.fd-support","tool_name":"source.read"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Swv9DvBHYa3wZ5ikrPtSBA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:da638550aff24675cea445e01c631b6666ebd1d89f9719d905123f53a401a671\",\"sha256\":\"da638550aff24675cea445e01c631b6666ebd1d89f9719d905123f53a401a671\"},\"id\":\"p2-read-how-p2850\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=abefb9450c3bbf2b09661870539202e8cced9057e16d76bc9f8ce62d0f3a9976]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"current application. Preflight.contract_state is exactly drafted, admitted,\\nrejected or superseded; decision is admitted/rejected only for the corresponding\\nmechanism decision and null for drafted/superseded. state_evidence is an array\\nof exact SourceRef/ArtifactRef evidence. Core's pure candidate is drafted with\\nno admission receipt; effects rechecks the relation and commits a new complete\\nadmitted or rejected receipt. The receipt's mechanism/authority/evidence never\\nchanges. Rejected is an actual recorded failed admission, not a relabeled\\ncandidate result. A later contract has its own digest and activation.\\n\\nOnly an existing owner's exact ContractSupersession source, explicitly selected\\namong the trusted Grant.authority_sources and authenticated by the operator's\\nseparate owner binding, may project superseded. Its closed schema is in the\\ncontent catalog above; it binds the exact predecessor contract digest, a\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[2850,2862]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"b38eedbe8