ges. Rejected is an actual recorded failed admission, not a relabeled\\ncandidate result. A later contract has its own digest and activation.\\n\\nOnly an existing owner's exact ContractSupersession source, explicitly selected\\namong the trusted Grant.authority_sources and authenticated by the operator's\\nseparate owner binding, may project superseded. Its closed schema is in the\\ncontent catalog above; it binds the exact predecessor contract digest, a\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[2850,2862]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005\",\"selected_sha256\":\"73fdd43a00bed1226b5a52c835322f75b824de030807bf9d31b77904914d07e3\",\"size_bytes\":925,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[2850,2862]},\"sha256\":\"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:da638550aff24675cea445e01c631b6666ebd1d89f9719d905123f53a401a671","sha256":"da638550aff24675cea445e01c631b6666ebd1d89f9719d905123f53a401a671"},"id":"p2-read-how-p2850","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=abefb9450c3bbf2b09661870539202e8cced9057e16d76bc9f8ce62d0f3a9976]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f"},"value":"returned"},"refusal":null,"result":{"artifact":null,"value":{"acquisition":{},"content":"current application. Preflight.contract_state is exactly drafted, admitted,\nrejected or superseded; decision is admitted/rejected only for the corresponding\nmechanism decision and null for drafted/superseded. state_evidence is an array\nof exact SourceRef/ArtifactRef evidence. Core's pure candidate is drafted with\nno admission receipt; effects rechecks the relation and commits a new complete\nadmitted or rejected receipt. The receipt's mechanism/authority/evidence never\nchanges. Rejected is an actual recorded failed admission, not a relabeled\ncandidate result. A later contract has its own digest and activation.\n\nOnly an existing owner's exact ContractSupersession source, explicitly selected\namong the trusted Grant.authority_sources and authenticated by the operator's\nseparate owner binding, may project superseded. Its closed schema is in the\ncontent catalog above; it binds the exact predecessor contract digest, a\n","coordinates":{"lines":[2850,2862]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005","selected_sha256":"73fdd43a00bed1226b5a52c835322f75b824de030807bf9d31b77904914d07e3","size_bytes":925,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[2850,2862]},"sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Swv9DvBHYa3wZ5ikrPtSBA","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
