ght of admitted\n    Every receipt is immutable.\n    Supersession is a separate exact owner record.\n    No public tool grants or performs supersession.\n  end note\n```\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> UnknownForUse: inspect admitted receipt\n  UnknownForUse --> Applicable: sufficient fresh authority and basis\n  UnknownForUse --> StaleForUse: actual material invalidator\n  Applicable --> Applicable: exact pre-effect recheck\n  Applicable --> StaleForUse: observed invalidator or authorized supersession\n  Applicable --> UnknownForUse: required observation unavailable\n  StaleForUse --> [*]: withdraw reliance on this use\n  note right of StaleForUse\n    Original contract_state and receipts remain history.\n    StaleForUse is not superseded.\n    New work requires its own exact contract.\n  end note\n```\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> IntentCommitted: validate complete Writer relation and persist intent\n  IntentCommitted --> NoTargetEffect: pre-publication failure observed\n","coordinates":{"lines":[2863,2920]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005","selected_sha256":"da0b34037606a42444bb8e78e5283221ffc6fc03c095cee823c021222494669b","size_bytes":2938,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[2863,2920]},"sha256":"b38eedbe85ee32ef11d945d6a60ed3f9bb2312ac10e873d8ddc9b7986744a005"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0136so6h6wyHXMKW2hXnyLtC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
